xfig-qt is xfig 3.2.9a, the Facility for Interactive Generation of figures,
running on Qt instead of X11.  xfig is the work of its authors below; its
home is https://sourceforge.net/projects/mcj/.  xfig-qt adds a layer that
runs xfig's unchanged C code on Qt.

This file says which parts come from where, and under which terms.


1. xfig
=======

From the xfig 3.2.9a distribution (xfig-3.2.9a.tar.xz):

  core/        xfig's src/ directory, unchanged.  core/config.h is not
               xfig's: it replaces the config.h that xfig's configure
               script would generate.
  data/Libraries/          the object libraries (Libraries/)
  data/doc/                the documentation (doc/)
  data/CompKeyDB           the compose key database
  data/app-defaults/Fig    the application defaults (app-defaults/Fig)
  data/xfig.png, data/org.xfig.xfig.desktop,
  data/org.xfig.xfig.metainfo.xml

They are distributed under xfig's license:

