3. What is not included
=======================

xfig-qt uses, but does not contain, Qt (LGPL-3.0 or GPL), fig2dev (xfig's
license), Ghostscript (AGPL-3.0), CUPS, fontconfig, FreeType, libpng,
libjpeg and libtiff.  They are installed separately, under their own
licenses.
